# Trivy misconfiguration findings accepted for this repository.
# Every entry needs a reason and an owner; reviewed by the platform team.

# AVD-AZU-0012 / AZU-0012: storage account without network rules (default action Allow).
# Applies to the Terraform state account (terraform/bootstrap). GitHub-hosted runners have no
# fixed egress IPs, so a network allow-list would break every deployment. Mitigations in place:
# shared-key auth disabled (Entra-only), no anonymous blobs, TLS 1.2, HTTPS only, blob versioning
# and soft delete, RBAC scoped per container. Production guidance (docs/terraform.md): self-hosted
# runners in the VNet with a private endpoint on the account. Owner: platform-team.
AVD-AZU-0012
AZU-0012
